# Repository Atlas: Command & Conquer Remastered Collection

## Project Responsibility

This repository contains the complete source code for the **Command & Conquer Remastered Collection**, comprising three primary components:

1. **TiberianDawn.dll** - The Tiberian Dawn (C&C1) game engine implemented in C++
2. **RedAlert.dll** - The Red Alert game engine implemented in C++
3. **CnCTDRAMapEditor** - A C# Windows Forms map editor application for both games

The codebase is structured for Windows-only compilation targeting the Steam Workshop integration (AppID 1213210). Licensed under GPL v3 with additional terms. The repository is archived for preservation purposes only and does not accept external contributions.

## System Entry Points

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `CnCRemastered.sln` | Primary Visual Studio solution building both game engines (TiberianDawn.dll, RedAlert.dll) |
| `CnCTDRAMapEditor.sln` | Visual Studio solution for the C# Map Editor application |
| `README.md` | Build instructions, dependencies, and license information |
| `LICENSE.md` | GPL v3 license with additional terms |
| `SCRIPTS/tgautil.py` | Python utility script for TGA texture processing |

**Build Output:** Compiled binaries are emitted to a root-level `bin/` directory after batch build in Visual Studio 2017 (recommended; later versions may report packing mismatch errors with Windows SDK headers).

**Required Dependencies:** Windows 8.1 SDK, MFC for Visual Studio C++.

---

## Directory Map (Aggregated)

| Directory | Responsibility Summary | Detailed Map |
|-----------|------------------------|--------------|
| `CnCTDRAMapEditor/` | **C# Map Editor Application** - Windows Forms desktop application for editing Tiberian Dawn and Red Alert maps. Contains UI controls, dialogs, rendering pipeline, model layer, Steamworks.NET integration, and game-specific logic for both titles. | [View Map](CnCTDRAMapEditor/codemap.md) |
| `REDALERT/` | **Red Alert Game Engine (C++)** - Core game logic for Command & Conquer: Red Alert. Includes unit/building AI, combat simulation, pathfinding, audio, animation, networking, resource management, and Win32 platform abstraction. | [View Map](REDALERT/codemap.md) |
| `TIBERIANDAWN/` | **Tiberian Dawn Game Engine (C++)** - Core game logic for Command & Conquer: Tiberian Dawn (C&C1). Shares architectural patterns with Red Alert but implements distinct unit rosters, campaigns, and balance. Includes house/faction logic, mission scripting, and legacy Westwood file format handlers. | [View Map](TIBERIANDAWN/codemap.md) |
| `SCRIPTS/` | **Build & Asset Utilities** - Python-based tooling for asset pipeline operations (currently `tgautil.py` for TGA texture manipulation). | [View Map](SCRIPTS/codemap.md) |
| `RUST/` | **Rust Reimplementation Workspace** - Modern cross-platform client reimplementing both engines. See [RUST/codemap.md](RUST/codemap.md) for details. |

